amstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694285","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5048060-1842846814455544","game_id":"steam-5048060","kind":"announcement","title":"TBF: Task Bar Fishing Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hello! We're the developer behind TBF: Task Bar Fishing.The demo is finally here! A girl fishes away on her own in the corner of your taskbar, and you step in only at the important moments to gather resources and uncover the secrets of a drowned world one by one. It's a small adventure that keeps going in a corner of your desktop while you get on with everything else.What you can enjoy in the demo 3 fishing areas and their story! (10+ more areas planned) Over 70 catchable items - we're planning ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455544","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5048060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5048060":"2026-10-25T22:31:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5048060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5119870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5048060","app_id":5048060,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_suc